---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Library: past questions and notes"
  description="The FreeStudentKit library of past questions and notes is not open yet. Here is how it will work and what you can use today."
>
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">Library</h1>
  <div class="card mt-6 max-w-2xl">
    <span class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-tint text-brand-strong"><Icon name="book" size={24} /></span>
    <h2 class="mt-3 text-xl font-bold">Not open yet, and empty on purpose</h2>
    <p class="mt-2 text-muted">
      Past questions and notes will appear here once students and lecturers who have the right to share them contribute them
      and they are checked. Until there is real material, this page shows none, instead of buttons that do nothing.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-3 text-muted">When it opens, you will be able to browse by school, department, course code and year, and report a wrong or copied file.</p>
    <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/tools/">Use the tools</a>
      <a class="btn" href="/scholarships/">See scholarships</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
